{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:51:55+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:51:55+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"OCI N.V.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","country":"Netherlands","city":"Amsterdam","website":"https://oci-global.com","employees":761,"summary":"OCI N.V. produces and distributes hydrogen-based and natural gas-based products to agricultural, transportation, and industrial customers in Europe, the Americas, the Middle East, Africa, Asia, and Oceania. It operates through Methanol US, Methanol Europe, and Nitrogen Europe segments. The company offers anhydrous ammonia, granular urea, urea ammonium nitrate solution, calcium ammonium nitrate, ammonium sulphate, ammonium nitrate + sulphur, renewable and lower carbon ammonia, nitric acid, melamine, carbon dioxide, and diesel exhaust fluid, as well as other nitrogen products. It also provides storage and shipment services for ammonia at the port of Rotterdam. The company was incorporated in 2013 and is headquartered in Amsterdam, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"OCI N.V. produit et distribue des produits à base d'hydrogène et de gaz naturel à des clients agricoles, de transport et industriels en Europe, en Amérique, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Asie et en Océanie. Elle opère à travers les segments Methanol US, Methanol Europe et Nitrogen Europe. La société propose de l'ammoniac anhydre, de l'urée granulaire, une solution de nitrate d'ammonium urée, du nitrate d'ammonium calcium, du sulfate d'ammonium, du nitrate d'ammonium + soufre, de l'ammoniac renouvelable et à faible teneur en carbone, de l'acide nitrique, de la mélamine, du dioxyde de carbone et du liquide d'échappement diesel, ainsi que d'autres produits à base d'azote."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":null,"shares_outstanding":null,"trailing_pe":